WEBVTT

00:01.700 --> 00:03.036
(The tassel crowns the knight.
The sword is snow white.)

00:03.060 --> 00:04.396
(In the silver saddle,
he rides like a shooting star.)

00:04.420 --> 00:07.636
(He kills a man within ten steps.
Invincible he is all the way ahead.)

00:07.660 --> 00:13.220
(He would leave once it's done.
No trace of him is to be found.)

01:26.220 --> 01:31.180
=Sword Snow Stride= (Season 1)

01:31.340 --> 01:34.580
=Episode 17=

01:35.380 --> 01:37.456
(Chunshen Lake Mushan Island)

01:37.480 --> 01:38.580
This way, please.

01:44.950 --> 01:46.606
Kneel down.

01:46.630 --> 01:49.880
(Chunshen Residence)

01:52.730 --> 01:54.570
All of my family

01:55.280 --> 01:56.970
are privileged to see Your Highness.

01:57.700 --> 01:58.890
Everyone, get up.

01:59.330 --> 02:01.050
You especially
don't need to kneel to me.

02:03.630 --> 02:04.820
Please get up.

02:05.050 --> 02:06.050
Get up.

02:09.080 --> 02:10.556
Why did you say

02:10.580 --> 02:12.356
I don't need to kneel to you?

02:12.380 --> 02:14.330
Because according to
military regulations,

02:14.650 --> 02:15.700
you don't have to kneel.

02:16.050 --> 02:18.490
But I retired from the army long ago.

02:18.630 --> 02:19.836
Once you were a soldier,

02:19.860 --> 02:21.180
you'll always be a soldier.

02:21.680 --> 02:23.150
You've never left the army.

02:25.980 --> 02:28.260
Wang Linquan,
foot soldier of Hupu Battalion,

02:28.680 --> 02:31.140
is honored to see Your Highness.

02:33.280 --> 02:34.890
Xu Fengnian,
junior of North Liang Army,

02:35.350 --> 02:36.610
is honored to see you.

02:38.780 --> 02:40.700
Under your leadership,

02:42.130 --> 02:44.090
North Liang will have a bright future.

02:45.700 --> 02:47.300
Your old servant

02:48.300 --> 02:49.746
can die in peace.

02:49.770 --> 02:50.980
Don't call yourself servant.

02:51.150 --> 02:52.540
You're an elder to me.

02:53.700 --> 02:54.770
All right.

02:56.000 --> 02:56.700
Chudong,

02:56.750 --> 02:57.750
come here.

03:03.000 --> 03:04.700
This is my daughter,

03:04.930 --> 03:05.857
Chudong.

03:05.881 --> 03:07.026
(Wang Linquan's youngest daughter
Wang Chudong)

03:07.050 --> 03:08.906
(Wang Linquan's youngest daughter Wang Chudong)
If you don't mind,

03:08.930 --> 03:10.930
let her wait upon you tonight.

03:12.130 --> 03:13.130
- Ah?
- Ah?

03:28.700 --> 03:29.700
Father.

03:33.050 --> 03:35.300
(Consort of Jing'an of Liyang
Pei Nanwei)

03:39.530 --> 03:41.050
Where are your manners?

03:44.000 --> 03:45.000
Aunt.

03:45.630 --> 03:46.770
It's wrong.

03:51.450 --> 03:52.450
Mother.

03:56.480 --> 03:58.210
You're in such a hurry.

03:58.330 --> 03:59.370
What happened?

03:59.650 --> 04:01.370
North Liang is our old enemy.

04:01.750 --> 04:03.380
You shouldn't humiliate yourself

04:03.650 --> 04:05.700
in front of the enemy.

04:06.850 --> 04:08.830
What nonsense are you talking about?

04:09.350 --> 04:11.700
You asked Wang Linquan
to welcome Xu Fengnian.

04:11.950 --> 04:13.430
You must've considered it thoroughly.

04:14.750 --> 04:16.500
But you shouldn't have let him
keel to Xu.

04:26.180 --> 04:27.540
Xu Xiao.

04:28.880 --> 04:31.080
What a master of intrigue.

04:33.750 --> 04:35.500
Does Wang work for Xu Xiao?

04:39.530 --> 04:40.530
Come back.

04:45.130 --> 04:46.130
Where are you going?

04:46.380 --> 04:48.060
I'm going to
kill the whole family of Wang.

04:49.900 --> 04:52.220
Wang has been working for me

04:52.250 --> 04:53.650
under a false identity for years.

04:55.700 --> 04:58.000
Why did he create such a big scene

04:58.500 --> 05:00.250
to meet Xu Fengnian today?

05:00.880 --> 05:02.610
What's his purpose

05:05.400 --> 05:07.050
of exposing his identity now?

05:08.680 --> 05:09.680
It's...

05:10.680 --> 05:12.370
It's a bargain.

05:12.700 --> 05:13.700
Bargain?

05:14.980 --> 05:18.250
Xu Xiao asked Wang
to expose his identity

05:18.830 --> 05:20.270
in order to show me

05:21.330 --> 05:23.530
he's voluntarily removed his spay

05:25.130 --> 05:27.130
in exchange for my guarantee.

05:28.280 --> 05:29.280
Guarantee of what?

05:30.830 --> 05:32.110
Xu Fengnian's hereditary dignity

05:32.230 --> 05:33.600
held in perpetuity.

05:34.700 --> 05:37.750
He wants me to guarantee
that I won't make difficulties.

05:39.550 --> 05:40.910
He's humiliating you.

05:43.530 --> 05:45.300
Xu Fengnian happens to be in Qingzhou.

05:45.550 --> 05:47.156
Shall we kill the Wang family

05:47.180 --> 05:48.180
and Xu together?

05:49.880 --> 05:51.340
Don't be anxious.

05:52.650 --> 05:54.750
Let's wait for Wang's visit.

05:55.400 --> 05:57.250
How could he come to court death?

05:57.380 --> 05:59.130
He must've run away with Xu Fengnian.

06:03.900 --> 06:04.900
You can go now.

06:21.780 --> 06:22.876
Did Wu Liuding say

06:22.900 --> 06:23.976
we can take action tomorrow?

06:24.000 --> 06:25.000
Yes.

06:27.130 --> 06:28.986
I'll lead the navy
out of camp tomorrow

06:29.010 --> 06:30.370
to intercept and kill Xu Fengnian.

06:31.850 --> 06:33.030
Let him assist us.

06:51.650 --> 06:52.466
Who is it?

06:52.490 --> 06:53.490
Me.

06:58.230 --> 06:59.230
Your Highness.

06:59.800 --> 07:01.130
Let me introduce to you.

07:01.600 --> 07:04.010
This is Mr. Wang Linquan.

07:06.530 --> 07:09.090
Aren't you Mr. Lin, the Third Graduate
in the Palace Examination?

07:10.430 --> 07:13.660
Lord of Jing'an is determined to

07:14.630 --> 07:16.050
exterminate your entire family,

07:16.100 --> 07:17.500
leaving no chance for your revival.

07:18.050 --> 07:20.230
I'm in charge of it.

07:22.000 --> 07:23.276
But General

07:23.300 --> 07:25.860
gave your family a chance to live.

07:28.680 --> 07:29.680
Your mother

07:30.930 --> 07:32.340
is right in my residence.

07:36.300 --> 07:37.050
My mother...

07:37.130 --> 07:38.130
Is my mother here?

07:39.150 --> 07:40.150
Come.

07:40.880 --> 07:42.100
I'll take you to see her.

07:55.250 --> 07:56.730
Your mother is in there.

08:35.480 --> 08:36.540
Who is it?

08:45.480 --> 08:47.550
(Lin's mother)

08:52.150 --> 08:53.150
Mother.

08:57.550 --> 08:59.420
It was all my fault that

09:00.700 --> 09:02.180
our family got into such a situation.

09:03.580 --> 09:05.620
I can't atone for my sin
even I die a hundred times.

09:17.930 --> 09:20.630
North Liang is a dangerous place.

09:21.030 --> 09:22.680
How did you escape

09:26.130 --> 09:27.950
after the failed assassination?

09:39.600 --> 09:40.960
Tell me.

09:44.980 --> 09:46.260
I've taken refuge

09:50.830 --> 09:52.730
under North Liang.

09:57.650 --> 09:58.650
Mother.

09:59.450 --> 10:00.660
How many members of our family

10:01.030 --> 10:02.850
are there left alive?

10:03.480 --> 10:04.706
I come back this time

10:04.730 --> 10:05.946
to send all of you

10:05.970 --> 10:07.490
to North Liang.

10:08.400 --> 10:09.400
Rest assured.

10:10.300 --> 10:11.970
I will avenge myself on it.

10:13.280 --> 10:14.280
Come here.

10:33.850 --> 10:35.300
As a

10:35.850 --> 10:37.610
scholar-gentry family,

10:39.380 --> 10:41.500
we cherish ethics,
rites and law the most.

10:42.550 --> 10:45.180
Xu Xiao is actually a traitor.

10:45.800 --> 10:47.780
Everyone has the right to kill him.

10:49.180 --> 10:51.630
I was proud that

10:51.930 --> 10:54.090
you went to assassinate Xu Fengnian.

10:54.580 --> 10:56.636
Nobody would blame you even if

10:56.660 --> 10:58.380
our entire family was exterminated.

11:00.480 --> 11:03.930
I didn't expect you to be a coward.

11:06.380 --> 11:08.380
I'd rather you die

11:10.030 --> 11:13.660
than you live in infamy!

11:13.980 --> 11:14.980
Mother.

11:17.280 --> 11:19.230
You've turned to North Liang now.

11:20.150 --> 11:22.050
Don't call me mother again.

11:24.830 --> 11:26.140
You're

11:26.500 --> 11:28.600
dead to me.

11:38.080 --> 11:40.300
The Lin Family will stay in Qingzhou.

11:41.380 --> 11:44.020
No one will follow you to North Liang.

11:47.050 --> 11:48.050
Get out.

12:58.500 --> 13:00.900
I can send your family out of Qingzhou,

13:01.450 --> 13:03.300
but I have two conditions.

13:04.930 --> 13:05.930
Shoot.

13:06.450 --> 13:07.500
First,

13:08.100 --> 13:10.280
the Lin family has been
stationed in Qingzhou for years

13:10.430 --> 13:11.830
with deep foundation.

13:12.500 --> 13:14.300
Even though they were exterminated,

13:14.430 --> 13:17.280
there are still
old subordinates of theirs.

13:17.730 --> 13:20.236
I want you to
take a ship to town tomorrow

13:20.260 --> 13:22.500
and contact the old subordinates.

13:24.400 --> 13:25.440
What for?

13:26.450 --> 13:30.020
The Lin Family has been fighting
against Lord of Jing'an for years.

13:30.150 --> 13:32.706
They must know

13:32.730 --> 13:34.660
many of his dirty secrets.

13:35.330 --> 13:36.330
OK.

13:37.300 --> 13:39.500
I'll find out all his secrets

13:39.700 --> 13:40.756
and tell you.

13:40.780 --> 13:43.130
Don't tell me.

13:44.150 --> 13:45.570
Tell His Highness.

13:50.280 --> 13:51.780
What's the other condition?

13:52.500 --> 13:54.300
From now on,

13:54.830 --> 13:57.620
you must live only for
the safety of His Highness.

13:58.330 --> 14:00.546
If he sustains any minor injury

14:00.570 --> 14:02.516
in Qingzhou,

14:02.540 --> 14:06.180
I'll turn your family over
to Lord of Jing'an.

14:06.350 --> 14:07.086
Do you understand?

14:07.110 --> 14:07.946
Uncle Wang.

14:07.970 --> 14:08.970
Hey.

14:09.030 --> 14:10.130
Your Highness.

14:10.330 --> 14:12.236
It's General's idea.

14:12.260 --> 14:13.820
Let me take care of it.

14:18.580 --> 14:20.180
I'll die fighting for His Highness.

14:21.230 --> 14:22.780
Till then,

14:24.350 --> 14:26.900
I'll never let him get hurt
or put him in danger.

14:27.430 --> 14:28.450
Good.

14:30.000 --> 14:31.800
Keep that in mind.

14:36.650 --> 14:37.780
Well,

14:39.330 --> 14:41.130
about my daughter...

14:41.750 --> 14:42.750
I was

14:43.230 --> 14:45.066
graceless.

14:45.090 --> 14:46.140
Never mind.

14:46.200 --> 14:47.880
You're an elder to me.

14:47.950 --> 14:48.996
How can I do that

14:49.020 --> 14:50.066
to your daughter?

14:50.090 --> 14:51.506
But I'm willing to devote her to you.

14:51.530 --> 14:53.230
But she is not.

14:53.830 --> 14:54.830
Oh.

14:55.000 --> 14:56.180
That's right.

14:56.620 --> 14:57.620
Right.

14:57.830 --> 14:59.430
I'll persuade her.

15:10.150 --> 15:11.590
I'll accompany you to town tomorrow.

15:16.230 --> 15:18.630
Hopefully Xu Fengnian
leaves the island today.

15:19.650 --> 15:21.430
If he doesn't,

15:21.950 --> 15:23.400
we'll go all the way to the island.

15:24.400 --> 15:25.850
How mighty you are!

15:26.980 --> 15:28.826
(Chunshen Residence)

15:28.850 --> 15:30.780
Please take care of yourself.

15:31.300 --> 15:32.300
This way.

15:34.330 --> 15:36.540
I'll leave Fengzi Battalion to you.

15:37.450 --> 15:39.756
Lord of Jing'an
has been living in Xiangfan for long.

15:39.780 --> 15:40.637
Once you go to town,

15:40.661 --> 15:42.780
your life is in his hands.

15:43.030 --> 15:44.030
Don't worry.

15:44.350 --> 15:45.806
Even if he wants to kill me,

15:45.830 --> 15:46.900
he won't do it in town.

15:47.130 --> 15:48.706
Why don't you
take Fengzi Battalion with you?

15:48.730 --> 15:49.826
Without transfer orders
from the Ministry of War

15:49.850 --> 15:51.026
and the imperial edict,

15:51.050 --> 15:52.810
the army of North Liang
can't enter Xiangfan.

15:53.150 --> 15:54.556
Xu Xiao is on his way to the capital.

15:54.580 --> 15:55.860
Don't give our enemy any excuse.

15:56.130 --> 15:57.690
Sounds reasonable.

15:57.830 --> 15:59.356
We have to leave now.

15:59.380 --> 16:00.516
Wait for a minute.

16:00.540 --> 16:01.540
Wait for what?

16:01.750 --> 16:02.850
She'll come soon.

16:03.780 --> 16:04.780
In a minute.

16:11.550 --> 16:12.980
Father, do you want to see me?

16:13.050 --> 16:14.550
You need a person

16:14.630 --> 16:17.300
who is familiar with Xiangfan
during the trip.

16:17.480 --> 16:19.956
Let Chudong go with you.

16:19.980 --> 16:21.156
At night,

16:21.180 --> 16:23.226
you may have a chat
and get acquainted with each other.

16:23.250 --> 16:24.300
I won't go.

16:25.080 --> 16:26.116
Don't be childish.

16:26.140 --> 16:27.186
Isn't it enough that

16:27.210 --> 16:28.456
our family take such a big risk
for North Liang?

16:28.480 --> 16:29.970
Why must you devote me to him?

16:30.630 --> 16:32.030
What's so great about him?

16:32.150 --> 16:33.376
He was just born in a powerful family.

16:33.400 --> 16:34.850
You're ridiculous!

16:37.330 --> 16:39.306
I'm ashamed.

16:39.330 --> 16:40.090
Uncle Wang.

16:40.350 --> 16:41.426
I'm going to town by myself.

16:41.450 --> 16:42.810
Don't bother your daughter.

16:43.280 --> 16:44.280
Well...

16:46.450 --> 16:48.666
She has been spoiled since childhood.

16:48.690 --> 16:50.066
Please forgive her

16:50.090 --> 16:52.080
for being impolite.

16:52.680 --> 16:53.780
Don't mention it.

16:53.950 --> 16:54.876
Please stay.

16:54.900 --> 16:55.657
We'll see you soon.

16:55.681 --> 16:56.690
Take care.

16:57.950 --> 16:59.050
Take care.

17:06.900 --> 17:08.466
The girl talked nonsense just now.

17:08.490 --> 17:09.490
Your Highness,

17:09.930 --> 17:11.290
don't be angry.

17:11.500 --> 17:13.180
How could I be angry with her?

17:13.580 --> 17:14.580
Grandpa Wei,

17:15.150 --> 17:16.606
I feel uncomfortable

17:16.630 --> 17:17.746
because I probably know

17:17.770 --> 17:19.490
Xu Xiao's plans in Qingzhou.

17:20.900 --> 17:22.740
Xu Xiao has a similar style
to my master.

17:23.080 --> 17:24.620
His plans are usually interlinked.

17:25.950 --> 17:27.450
Since Uncle Wang is exposed,

17:27.580 --> 17:28.730
I think his next move

17:28.880 --> 17:30.070
has been quite ready.

17:30.200 --> 17:32.906
I've figured it out
since Wang Linquan proposed to

17:32.930 --> 17:34.250
let his daughter sleep with me.

17:34.550 --> 17:35.550
Oh.

17:35.830 --> 17:37.376
Let's talk about it
after we get into town.

17:37.400 --> 17:38.660
Hopefully I worried too much.

17:44.350 --> 17:47.300
(Chunshen Residence)

18:01.030 --> 18:02.396
Didn't I give you orders

18:02.420 --> 18:03.860
and ask you to stay on the island?

18:04.030 --> 18:05.490
We're all dressed as scholars.

18:05.680 --> 18:06.427
Everything will be fine.

18:06.451 --> 18:08.300
Will a scholar take this?

18:08.880 --> 18:10.000
Put it away.

18:12.930 --> 18:14.250
What about the two little fellas?

18:14.980 --> 18:16.556
They stayed on the island

18:16.580 --> 18:17.706
with Yu Youwei.

18:17.730 --> 18:18.956
She has a cat.

18:18.980 --> 18:20.340
She may take care of them.

18:21.380 --> 18:22.100
Go away.

18:22.150 --> 18:23.150
Go away.

18:25.600 --> 18:26.600
Go away.

18:28.900 --> 18:30.060
Go away.

18:32.600 --> 18:33.750
Don't come.

18:34.600 --> 18:35.557
Don't come.

18:35.581 --> 18:36.730
Stay away.

19:10.300 --> 19:11.300
Your Highness.

19:12.980 --> 19:13.980
There are ships.

19:37.030 --> 19:38.396
What a coincidence.

19:38.420 --> 19:40.250
It seems God wants him to die.

19:53.130 --> 19:54.316
Father. Come here.

19:54.340 --> 19:55.340
Look.

19:57.380 --> 19:58.530
The navy of Qingzhou.

20:00.430 --> 20:01.690
If you saw it,

20:02.530 --> 20:04.290
why didn't you take me to the dock?

20:05.250 --> 20:06.530
It's too late.

20:06.900 --> 20:08.746
It's too late when you get to the dock

20:08.770 --> 20:09.930
and take a boat.

20:10.700 --> 20:11.700
I...

20:12.480 --> 20:15.050
I should have gone with His Highness.

20:32.650 --> 20:33.450
He's about to run into them.

20:33.580 --> 20:35.730
Zhao Heng and his son are not fools.

20:36.100 --> 20:37.660
If they kill His Highness,

20:37.900 --> 20:39.820
the army of North Liang
will storm into Qingzhou.

20:49.100 --> 20:50.690
We mustn't miss the chance today.

20:51.180 --> 20:52.210
After he's dead,

20:52.300 --> 20:54.356
we'll send his body to North Liang.

20:54.380 --> 20:56.010
It's good enough.

20:58.330 --> 20:59.860
Don't mind his father.

21:00.130 --> 21:01.226
When he arrives,

21:01.250 --> 21:02.570
Xu Fengnian will be dead already.

21:03.700 --> 21:04.700
Don't move the flagship.

21:04.880 --> 21:05.706
The left and right ships,

21:05.730 --> 21:06.580
sink the enemies' ship.

21:06.730 --> 21:07.810
None of them shall survive!

21:13.500 --> 21:14.930
They are coming to us.

21:18.630 --> 21:20.280
Halt!

21:25.530 --> 21:26.730
Take in sail.

21:38.480 --> 21:40.426
What's the pole used for?

21:40.450 --> 21:41.526
It's patting pole,

21:41.550 --> 21:42.556
used to smash ship.

21:42.580 --> 21:44.060
It's tremendously heavy.

21:44.530 --> 21:46.140
With two pats,

21:46.250 --> 21:47.410
the ship will sink.

22:10.700 --> 22:11.637
Your Highness.

22:11.661 --> 22:12.750
Can we use our weapons?

22:13.130 --> 22:14.130
Sure.

22:16.280 --> 22:17.280
Here.

22:23.970 --> 22:25.200
Break off!

22:47.380 --> 22:48.380
Fengqi.

23:07.200 --> 23:08.440
What a valiant general.

23:12.500 --> 23:13.580
He's great.

23:32.280 --> 23:33.280
Get ready!

23:35.100 --> 23:36.800
(Zhao)

23:38.730 --> 23:40.350
(Zhao)

23:45.900 --> 23:47.450
(Zhao)

24:04.630 --> 24:05.980
(Zhao)

24:11.430 --> 24:12.430
(Zhao)

24:13.900 --> 24:15.250
(Zhao)

24:37.330 --> 24:38.090
Thanks.

24:38.230 --> 24:39.157
Thank His Highness.

24:39.181 --> 24:40.261
He asked me to protect you.

25:18.390 --> 25:19.540
Ning Emei.

25:20.160 --> 25:20.807
Yes.

25:20.831 --> 25:21.960
Seize the ship.

25:35.270 --> 25:35.566
Wow.

25:35.590 --> 25:37.010
What a bold strategy!

25:42.850 --> 25:43.510
Grandpa Wei,

25:43.760 --> 25:44.960
can you go aboard the ship?

25:45.030 --> 25:46.210
A piece of cake.

26:01.730 --> 26:04.230
Is he going to pull the ship by hand?

26:05.130 --> 26:07.386
Sir, please help us.

26:07.410 --> 26:08.710
They are just small fry

26:08.930 --> 26:10.130
unworthy of being my opponent.

26:37.370 --> 26:38.890
Does he have supernatural power?

26:39.370 --> 26:40.650
It looks like Chixia Swordplay.

27:20.760 --> 27:21.760
Enough.

29:05.830 --> 29:07.970
It's said that North Liang have
many masters.

29:08.310 --> 29:09.540
As we can see,

29:10.140 --> 29:11.630
they deserve the reputation.

29:18.740 --> 29:19.940
Get my Immortal Arm Bow.

29:20.310 --> 29:21.310
Yes.

29:30.630 --> 29:31.740
It's all right.

29:32.840 --> 29:34.520
Your family have been
sent away one by one.

29:34.960 --> 29:36.220
Uncle Wang saved many people.

30:25.660 --> 30:27.350
He didn't knock walnut in vain.

30:27.510 --> 30:29.700
He's almost mastered Dahuangting.

30:39.740 --> 30:40.870
They finally come.

30:44.710 --> 30:45.780
Yet they don't move.

30:45.840 --> 30:47.366
I'm afraid they're frightened to death.

30:47.390 --> 30:49.136
The so-called Sword Tomb
of the Wu family is just so-so.

30:49.160 --> 30:51.196
Witnessing the fight,

30:51.220 --> 30:52.500
why doesn't the boat leave?

31:11.240 --> 31:12.500
What does he want?

31:22.290 --> 31:23.350
Who is this?

31:34.560 --> 31:35.700
Is that Xu Fengnian?

31:36.540 --> 31:37.540
Who is it?

31:38.140 --> 31:39.140
Sword Tomb.

31:39.490 --> 31:40.590
Wu Liuding.

31:41.040 --> 31:41.910
Your mother

31:42.010 --> 31:43.780
fled from her family

31:44.060 --> 31:45.740
and damaged its reputation.

31:46.210 --> 31:47.410
Someone must

31:48.340 --> 31:49.830
pay for that.

31:50.010 --> 31:51.610
Mother's debt should be paid by her son.

31:51.990 --> 31:53.460
I will bear

31:53.940 --> 31:55.110
my mother's misfortune.

31:59.490 --> 32:00.886
If you have the guts,

32:00.910 --> 32:02.510
go to North Liang to collect your debts.

32:14.660 --> 32:15.830
If you say so,

32:17.110 --> 32:18.150
I won't stop you.

32:20.980 --> 32:22.290
What is he doing?

32:43.290 --> 32:45.330
Is Sword Tomb of the Wu family
actually so powerful?

33:11.690 --> 33:13.690
(Zhao)

33:57.510 --> 33:59.430
Don't you dare annoy me!

34:00.940 --> 34:01.996
Who're you?

34:02.020 --> 34:03.310
None of your business.

34:20.560 --> 34:21.560
Your Highness!

34:27.860 --> 34:46.710
(Zhao)

34:46.710 --> 34:48.470
He can use
his genuine spirit skillfully.

34:50.690 --> 34:52.380
Who is the old man?

35:01.640 --> 35:02.640
Catch.

35:49.150 --> 35:50.170
Retreat!

35:53.170 --> 35:54.170
Here.

35:56.590 --> 35:57.680
Fujiang Armor.

36:00.120 --> 36:01.160
Take care.

36:05.570 --> 36:06.640
Throw halberds.

36:35.570 --> 36:37.280
Where did the armor come from?

36:38.740 --> 36:40.020
Who are the people

36:40.090 --> 36:40.927
on the flagship

36:40.951 --> 36:42.430
trying to assassinate Xu Fengnian?

36:43.740 --> 36:45.280
No matter who they are,

36:45.640 --> 36:47.320
they've made a big mistake.

36:48.090 --> 36:50.430
Attacking the son of Lord of North Liang

36:51.140 --> 36:53.340
is a crime that can be
directly reported to the emperor.

37:03.720 --> 37:05.870
His ship comes over.

37:06.640 --> 37:08.080
He's well protected by those freaks.

37:08.190 --> 37:09.390
It's hard to kill him.

37:09.590 --> 37:10.816
(Zhao)

37:10.840 --> 37:11.776
Bring him up.

37:11.800 --> 37:12.800
Yes.

37:13.520 --> 37:14.760
You're not with the government.

37:15.090 --> 37:16.120
You'd better leave.

37:16.920 --> 37:17.920
I'm getting off, then.

37:17.990 --> 37:19.760
I'll call on you
when I get back to town.

37:47.470 --> 37:50.920
Son of Lord of Jing'an invites
Son of Lord of North Liang to board.

38:04.440 --> 38:06.760
I've long heard of your name.

38:06.990 --> 38:08.390
Today I have the honor to meet you.

38:08.570 --> 38:09.800
You're true to your name.

38:11.570 --> 38:13.350
Son of Lord of Jing'an.

38:14.040 --> 38:15.240
That's me.

38:15.790 --> 38:17.160
Did you try to kill me?

38:18.240 --> 38:19.160
It's a shame.

38:19.240 --> 38:21.370
I was on a drill with the navy,

38:21.440 --> 38:23.120
not expecting a villain took over power.

38:23.570 --> 38:24.600
The villain dared to

38:24.690 --> 38:26.680
assassinate Mr. Xu.

38:26.870 --> 38:28.340
Fortunately, you're not hurt.

38:28.490 --> 38:30.470
I'm so relieved.

38:36.920 --> 38:38.280
Didn't you say he took over power?

38:38.870 --> 38:40.240
Why is he tied up?

38:42.070 --> 38:43.326
During the chaos,

38:43.350 --> 38:44.406
I took the opportunity

38:44.430 --> 38:45.740
to overpower him.

38:45.970 --> 38:47.390
Except for seizing the ship,

38:47.440 --> 38:49.366
he tried to assassinate you.

38:49.390 --> 38:50.736
He is so vicious.

38:50.760 --> 38:51.760
Who is he?

38:52.120 --> 38:53.196
The son of Wei Dong,

38:53.220 --> 38:54.260
and the commander of navy,

38:54.570 --> 38:55.570
Wei Wei.

38:55.840 --> 38:57.320
Was him the one who shot arrows?

38:57.720 --> 38:58.886
Yes, it was him.

38:58.910 --> 39:00.316
Does he know

39:00.340 --> 39:01.800
it's a capital crime?

39:02.040 --> 39:03.340
You're right.

39:03.790 --> 39:05.510
Assassinating the son of
Lord of North Liang

39:05.670 --> 39:07.056
is surely a capital crime.

39:07.080 --> 39:08.057
Let me

39:08.081 --> 39:09.220
seek justice

39:09.820 --> 39:10.820
for you.

39:24.640 --> 39:25.640
Mr. Xu,

39:25.840 --> 39:26.840
have you cooled down?

39:27.590 --> 39:29.030
You're fast.

39:29.420 --> 39:30.466
To eliminate traitors for the country

39:30.490 --> 39:31.490
is of great urgency.

39:38.040 --> 39:40.280
You're fully prepared, aren't you?

39:40.590 --> 39:43.280
I don't know what you're talking about.

39:44.440 --> 39:46.430
Don't you
have any responsibilities at all?

39:48.870 --> 39:51.160
After all, it was my man who did this.

39:51.740 --> 39:52.910
Though I'm innocent,

39:53.070 --> 39:55.030
I must be blamed for
not disciplining them well.

39:55.140 --> 39:56.690
Please forgive me, Mr. Xu.

39:58.540 --> 39:59.740
Would you have a drink with me

39:59.870 --> 40:02.140
so I can make an apology?

40:08.820 --> 40:10.170
There's blood on your nose.

40:11.190 --> 40:12.190
Thanks.

40:17.190 --> 40:18.190
What do you want?

40:18.520 --> 40:21.120
Don't waste your money
on inviting me to drink.

40:21.270 --> 40:22.840
I'll take that as your apology.

40:23.190 --> 40:24.256
Xu Fengnian!

40:24.280 --> 40:25.280
Em?

40:26.440 --> 40:27.840
Why don't you call me Mr. Xu?

40:37.570 --> 40:39.120
As long as it cools you down.

40:41.120 --> 40:42.680
You're broad-minded.

40:42.790 --> 40:45.120
Lord of Jing'an has a good son.

40:45.990 --> 40:46.990
I'm impressed.

41:07.520 --> 41:08.720
They are all right.

41:09.020 --> 41:11.696
Xu Fengnian has many masters
work for him.

41:11.720 --> 41:13.720
How can you call his name directly?

41:14.190 --> 41:17.070
He has a lecherous
and lustful reputation.

41:17.190 --> 41:19.270
I didn't expect him
to be worse than in the rumors.

41:20.040 --> 41:21.296
On arriving at the island,

41:21.320 --> 41:22.670
he wants to take me away.

41:23.170 --> 41:24.486
I won't listen to

41:24.510 --> 41:25.740
such a playboy.

41:26.540 --> 41:27.600
It has nothing to do

41:27.840 --> 41:29.430
with His Highness.

41:30.220 --> 41:31.600
I proposed it.

41:33.770 --> 41:36.240
When he leaves Xiangfan,

41:37.820 --> 41:39.370
you should go with him.

41:39.570 --> 41:40.966
You just met him,

41:40.990 --> 41:42.890
yet you want
to devote your daughter to him.

41:43.140 --> 41:44.240
Why?

41:46.840 --> 41:48.520
It's for your own good.

41:56.620 --> 41:59.390
The assassin
who ambushed from underwater

42:00.370 --> 42:01.920
was Fujiang Armor again.

42:02.040 --> 42:03.600
It seems that those who want to kill me

42:03.640 --> 42:05.120
have followed me to Qingzhou.

42:06.320 --> 42:08.160
Whose instigation was he under?

42:08.790 --> 42:10.590
Was it Zhao Xun?

42:11.370 --> 42:13.006
If it was him,

42:13.030 --> 42:14.776
Fujiang Armor would

42:14.800 --> 42:15.990
cooperate better with him.

42:16.220 --> 42:17.736
The one who tried to kill me

42:17.760 --> 42:19.290
was using Zhao Xun.

42:19.690 --> 42:20.720
Unfortunately...

42:21.890 --> 42:23.470
Unfortunately, we don't know who it is.

42:24.870 --> 42:26.200
We'll meet again.

43:30.100 --> 43:32.820
♪ The flower of pain ♪

43:34.590 --> 43:37.390
♪ Blooms in my heart ♪

43:39.320 --> 43:42.240
♪ I made a bet with the dawn ♪

43:43.320 --> 43:47.120
♪ That you'll answer ♪

43:48.420 --> 43:51.320
♪ Forgive this tragic end ♪

43:53.020 --> 43:55.840
♪ Moved by the moment we met ♪

43:57.840 --> 44:00.600
♪ In spite of thunder and lightning ♪

44:01.620 --> 44:05.540
♪ In spite of my falling ♪

44:06.040 --> 44:08.776
♪ When we are apart ♪

44:08.800 --> 44:10.040
♪ I'll collapse ♪

44:10.820 --> 44:14.680
♪ Capture an image of the memory ♪

44:15.490 --> 44:18.216
♪ After all these ups and downs ♪

44:18.240 --> 44:19.680
♪ The vanity ♪

44:20.170 --> 44:24.040
♪ Who will open it again ♪

44:24.470 --> 44:25.816
♪ It's worth it ♪

44:25.840 --> 44:28.680
♪ It's enough ♪

44:29.090 --> 44:31.576
♪ Drowned in sadness ♪

44:31.600 --> 44:34.000
♪ Just to see through ♪

44:34.290 --> 44:36.316
♪ I will whisper love to you ♪

44:36.340 --> 44:38.516
♪ For a lifetime ♪

44:38.540 --> 44:42.760
♪ End the worry in the world ♪

44:43.120 --> 44:44.256
♪ It's worth it ♪

44:44.280 --> 44:47.320
♪ I'll be there for you all my life ♪

44:47.490 --> 44:49.456
♪ After the moments of beauty ♪

44:49.480 --> 44:52.200
♪ You are my reason to be ♪

44:52.760 --> 44:54.576
♪ If there is a way ♪

44:54.600 --> 44:57.096
♪ To start over ♪

44:57.120 --> 45:01.170
♪ Will you still remember me ♪
